      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveQuerydslMongoPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.support\"><code>ReactiveQuerydslMongoPredicateExecutor</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../query/MongoEntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>MongoEntityInformation</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../core/ReactiveMongoOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveMongoOperations</code></a>. Uses the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/SimpleEntityPathResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>SimpleEntityPathResolver</code></a> to create an <code>EntityPath</code> for the\ngiven domain class.",
